            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96150?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">interactive-widget</code> to the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta name=\"viewport\"&gt;</code> reference documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">interactive-widget</code> was documented only in the guide at <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Guides/Viewport_meta_element\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Guides/Viewport_meta_element</a> … I was confused when it was missing from the reference materials.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I copied and pasted the core features from the guide into this PR.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">FYI, BCD data for this page is broken. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2715504565\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311\">mdn/browser-compat-data#25311</a> (That's unrelated to my changes here.) There's an in-progress PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2735978034\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25392\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25392/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25392\">mdn/browser-compat-data#25392</a> to address it.</p>",
