        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per the following comments:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3224157354\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40327\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40327/hovercard?comment_id=3014466649&amp;comment_type=review\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40327#pullrequestreview-3014466649\">#40327 (review)</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3224157354\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40327\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40327/hovercard?comment_id=3014482829&amp;comment_type=review\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40327#pullrequestreview-3014482829\">#40327 (review)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR attempts to make all the \"test your skills\" boilerplate a bit more consistent.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is quite a lot to review, so apologies, but it should be a matter of looking at a few to make sure the boilerplate looks OK, and then skimming the live pages to make sure nothing looks broken.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
